# Copy to frontend/.env.local for local development. Never commit real values.

# Read from feat/frontend-foundation onwards.
# Where Next.js proxies /api/* (needed at build time).
# BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:4000
# Same value as the backend's JWT_SECRET; used by proxy.ts to verify the session cookie.
# JWT_SECRET=change-me-to-at-least-32-random-characters
